[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Photon compositor (picom)
Name[ru]=Композитор Photon (picom)
Comment=Shadows, translucency and blur for the Deepin-style look
Comment[ru]=Тени, полупрозрачность и блюр для оформления в духе Deepin
TryExec=picom
Exec=/bin/sh -c "pgrep -x picom >/dev/null || picom --config /etc/photon/picom.conf --daemon"
Terminal=false
Categories=System;
